[{"text": "The assembly will hear an address by His", "start": 2.32, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Excellency Gitanas Naeta, President of", "start": 5.839, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "the Republic of Lithuania.", "start": 10.0, "duration": 5.519}, {"text": "I request protocol to escort his", "start": 12.639, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "excellency and invite him to address the", "start": 15.519, "duration": 6.441}, {"text": "assembly.", "start": 18.96, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "Oh yes,", "start": 36.719, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": ">> your excellency Madame President,", "start": 38.879, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "excellencies, ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 42.719, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "35 years ago,", "start": 46.559, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "Lethia returned to its rightful place in", "start": 49.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "the global community of sovereign", "start": 52.239, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "states.", "start": 54.8, "duration": 3.84}, {"text": "By joining the United Nations, we", "start": 56.399, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "reaffirmed our strong", "start": 58.64, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "commitment to the global order based on", "start": 61.76, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "international law, territorial", "start": 65.04, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "integrity, state sovereignity, and human", "start": 67.36, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "dignity.", "start": 70.88, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "It was a glorious moment for a nation", "start": 72.88, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "well taught by historical experience", "start": 75.68, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "that freedom and independence cannot be", "start": 78.88, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "taken for granted.", "start": 82.32, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "They must be constantly and consistently", "start": 85.119, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "defended.", "start": 88.96, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Today I am standing here to speak for", "start": 91.36, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "the same dream that inspired Lithuania", "start": 94.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "in 1991.", "start": 97.119, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "the vision of the more just, secure, and", "start": 100.0, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "peaceful world.", "start": 103.36, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "Today, I am backing up the principles of", "start": 105.68, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "the United Nations, which sadly are", "start": 108.0, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "being put under increasing pressure.", "start": 111.2, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "Recent years have brought us numerous", "start": 115.2, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "highintensity and far-reaching conflicts", "start": 117.6, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "that dominate the global affairs on a", "start": 119.92, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "scale not seen in decades.", "start": 122.799, "duration": 6.001}, {"text": "We witness geopolitical instability in", "start": 126.159, "duration": 6.561}, {"text": "Europe, the Middle East, and elsewhere.", "start": 128.8, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "It is made worse by growing nuclear", "start": 132.72, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "ambitions in the Middle East and Asia,", "start": 135.84, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "as well as the response irresponsible", "start": 138.8, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "transfer of military related goods, dual", "start": 141.2, "duration": 7.84}, {"text": "use items, and sensitive technologies.", "start": 144.56, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "In recent months, Iran has continued", "start": 149.04, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "attacking neighboring countries, often", "start": 152.64, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "through its proxies, while actively", "start": 155.519, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "inquiring the freedom of navigation in", "start": 158.64, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "the Strait of Hormuz.", "start": 161.36, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "These actions constitute a serious", "start": 164.08, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "threat to regional and international", "start": 166.959, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "peace and security.", "start": 170.48, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "We reaffirm reaffirm our full solidarity", "start": 172.959, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "with the Gulf Cooperation Council", "start": 176.959, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "countries and Jordan. We call on Iran to", "start": 179.04, "duration": 7.6}, {"text": "hold its nuclear and missile programs as", "start": 183.599, "duration": 6.321}, {"text": "well as its collaboration with armed", "start": 186.64, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "groups across the Middle East.", "start": 189.92, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "Lithia commends all efforts to find a", "start": 193.36, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "solution ensuring freedom of navigation.", "start": 196.4, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "We will contribute with our demining", "start": 200.72, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "capabilities to the international", "start": 203.2, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "maritime missions in the strait of", "start": 205.44, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "Hormuz.", "start": 207.76, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "As regards the situation in the Gaza", "start": 209.92, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "Strip, my country supports international", "start": 212.4, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "efforts to maintain and consolidate the", "start": 215.28, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "ceasefire.", "start": 218.799, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "The comprehensive plan to end the Gaza", "start": 220.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "conflict, including the deployment of", "start": 223.92, "duration": 3.52}, {"text": "the temporary international", "start": 225.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "stabilization force, provides the", "start": 227.44, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "guidelines to follow.", "start": 230.08, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "Lithuania reiterates the importance of", "start": 232.56, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "full de demilitarization of non-state", "start": 235.04, "duration": 6.8}, {"text": "armed groups. Humanitarian aid must also", "start": 238.48, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "be allowed to reach those in need safely", "start": 241.84, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "and without obstruction.", "start": 244.879, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "To this day, the two-state solution", "start": 248.0, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "remains the only way towards a", "start": 251.36, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "comprehensive, just and lasting peace.", "start": 254.159, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "In this light, it is crucially important", "start": 258.0, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "to abstain from any farther actions", "start": 261.359, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "incompatible with a credible political", "start": 264.56, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "process.", "start": 267.84, "duration": 4.24}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 269.84, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "the one conflict that poses the greatest", "start": 272.08, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "threat to the world order is Russia's", "start": 275.12, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "war of aggression against Ukraine,", "start": 279.12, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "supported by its proxies.", "start": 281.84, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "In the 12 years since the illegal", "start": 284.8, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "occupation of Crimea,", "start": 287.44, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "Russia has escalated from clandestine", "start": 289.84, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "operations and limited warfare in", "start": 292.96, "duration": 7.2}, {"text": "eastern Ukraine to massive military", "start": 296.32, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "operations, mass killings, and", "start": 300.16, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "ultimately the largest drone attacks", "start": 303.6, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "against civilian infrastructure", "start": 306.08, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "the world has ever seen.", "start": 309.12, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "The current stage of the war, which", "start": 312.72, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "began with the full-scale invasion in", "start": 315.52, "duration": 4.959}, {"text": "February 2022,", "start": 317.919, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "has already lasted longer than the First", "start": 320.479, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "World War.", "start": 324.479, "duration": 6.481}, {"text": "In the last 55 months, Russia has", "start": 327.199, "duration": 6.881}, {"text": "suffered one and a half million military", "start": 330.96, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "casualties.", "start": 334.08, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "In the last year, it has gained 0.3% of", "start": 335.6, "duration": 7.68}, {"text": "Ukraine's territory at the cost of over", "start": 340.0, "duration": 8.4}, {"text": "400,000 soldiers killed and wounded.", "start": 343.28, "duration": 9.04}, {"text": "Yet all these enormous efforts, all that", "start": 348.4, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "blood and tears basically came to", "start": 352.32, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "nothing. Ukraine is still standing", "start": 355.52, "duration": 6.239}, {"text": "proudly as an independent state. The", "start": 358.0, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "Ukrainian language, culture, and", "start": 361.759, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "national identity are alive and", "start": 364.319, "duration": 5.281}, {"text": "thriving.", "start": 367.6, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "In all but name, Russia has already lost", "start": 369.6, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "the war. Yet, its leadership does not", "start": 373.36, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "allow itself to admit defeat, fearing", "start": 376.56, "duration": 5.759}, {"text": "international legal accountability and", "start": 379.28, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "possible revenge from its own people.", "start": 382.319, "duration": 7.921}, {"text": "As the inevitable approaches, the stakes", "start": 386.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "get higher and the Kremlin regime", "start": 390.24, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "increasingly find itself cornered.", "start": 392.16, "duration": 8.08}, {"text": "How much more Ukrainian civilian lives", "start": 396.72, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "will be sacrificed on Russia's war", "start": 400.24, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "altar?", "start": 403.36, "duration": 4.08}, {"text": "How many people will be tortured,", "start": 404.88, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "sexually assaulted, thrown into dark", "start": 407.44, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "dungeons, never to see the sunlight", "start": 411.039, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "again? How many children will be", "start": 413.759, "duration": 5.361}, {"text": "illegally separated from their parents", "start": 416.639, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "and sent to Russia to suffer", "start": 419.12, "duration": 4.4}, {"text": "indoctrination?", "start": 421.039, "duration": 6.241}, {"text": "We do not know the answers. Yet, we must", "start": 423.52, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "all feel the deep pain brought by this", "start": 427.28, "duration": 6.639}, {"text": "brutal and pointless war. And we all", "start": 430.16, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "should join our forces to draw Ukraine's", "start": 433.919, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "victory closer.", "start": 436.56, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "For it is only Ukraine's final victory,", "start": 439.039, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "safeguarding its sovereignity,", "start": 442.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "independence, and territorial integrity", "start": 444.72, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "that could ensure the global peace,", "start": 447.36, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "security, and credibility of the United", "start": 450.24, "duration": 5.28}, {"text": "Nations charter.", "start": 453.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "What we can not allow is a brute force", "start": 455.52, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "prevailing over international law. We", "start": 459.36, "duration": 6.48}, {"text": "cannot tolerate any longer Moscow's", "start": 463.44, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "colonial aspirations which undermine", "start": 465.84, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "global food security and driving up", "start": 469.28, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "fruit prices.", "start": 472.56, "duration": 4.479}, {"text": "Russia's imperial ambitions reach far", "start": 474.879, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "into Europe, Africa, and Asia. No", "start": 477.039, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "country should consider itself immune", "start": 480.479, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "from this threat.", "start": 483.039, "duration": 6.081}, {"text": "Naturally, Lethania witnesses many", "start": 486.16, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "dangers up close. In recent months,", "start": 489.12, "duration": 5.44}, {"text": "Russia's war of aggression has led to", "start": 492.16, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "numerous violations of our airspace by", "start": 494.56, "duration": 7.199}, {"text": "combat drones. Russia has also", "start": 498.72, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "intensified hybrid attacks,", "start": 501.759, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "disinformation, and sabotage efforts.", "start": 504.08, "duration": 6.959}, {"text": "Where Russia advances, opening Pandora's", "start": 507.919, "duration": 4.881}, {"text": "box of new techniques for", "start": 511.039, "duration": 3.44}, {"text": "destabilization,", "start": 512.8, "duration": 4.719}, {"text": "other hostile actors follow, learning", "start": 514.479, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "new skills and ideas.", "start": 517.519, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen,", "start": 520.88, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "attacks on information integrity pose an", "start": 523.12, "duration": 6.159}, {"text": "especially troubling challenge to every", "start": 526.64, "duration": 4.319}, {"text": "society.", "start": 529.279, "duration": 4.321}, {"text": "Disinformation foreign information", "start": 530.959, "duration": 5.761}, {"text": "manipulation and interference and the", "start": 533.6, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "falsification of history erode trust,", "start": 536.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "restrict civic space and target", "start": 540.32, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "journalists and human rights defenders.", "start": 543.12, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "As a result, human rights, democracy and", "start": 546.48, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "security suffer.", "start": 550.0, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "This risk is further enhanced by the", "start": 552.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "development of artificial intelligence.", "start": 555.36, "duration": 7.28}, {"text": "As we all know, AI has a huge potential", "start": 558.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "for transformation,", "start": 562.64, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "especially in the field of economy.", "start": 564.56, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "Whole sectors, including those related", "start": 567.44, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "to defense and security, might get", "start": 570.64, "duration": 6.319}, {"text": "radically changed or destroyed almost", "start": 573.6, "duration": 4.96}, {"text": "overnight.", "start": 576.959, "duration": 4.56}, {"text": "As any instrument, AI is also", "start": 578.56, "duration": 5.279}, {"text": "increasingly used by those seeking to", "start": 581.519, "duration": 5.681}, {"text": "cause harm and destruction.", "start": 583.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "My country, Lithuania, strongly believes", "start": 587.2, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "that the future of AI must not be", "start": 589.36, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "determined by authoritarian control,", "start": 592.56, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "technological coercion, or the malicious", "start": 595.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "use of data. We are therefore investing", "start": 598.8, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "in trusted AI cap capabilities,", "start": 602.32, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "promoting responsible AI deploy", "start": 605.519, "duration": 6.641}, {"text": "deployment and advancing the Wilnos", "start": 608.56, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "Convention, the world's first legally", "start": 612.16, "duration": 4.64}, {"text": "binding international treaty on", "start": 614.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "artificial intelligence.", "start": 616.8, "duration": 5.599}, {"text": "By demonstrating how shared principles", "start": 619.6, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "can be translated into concrete legal", "start": 622.399, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "commitments, we hope to contribute", "start": 624.8, "duration": 5.039}, {"text": "significantly to the United Nations", "start": 627.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "global dialogue on AI governance.", "start": 629.839, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "Lethini invites the international", "start": 633.839, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "community to unite in addressing", "start": 635.68, "duration": 6.399}, {"text": "significant legal, ethical, and", "start": 638.959, "duration": 6.401}, {"text": "strategic challenges posed by artificial", "start": 642.079, "duration": 5.121}, {"text": "intelligence.", "start": 645.36, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "With even major uh technology companies", "start": 647.2, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "sending warning signals that control of", "start": 650.24, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "AI might slip out of humanity's hands,", "start": 652.72, "duration": 7.52}, {"text": "the time is ripe for collective action.", "start": 656.48, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "Together, we must ensure that AI serves", "start": 660.24, "duration": 7.92}, {"text": "human dignity, sustainable development,", "start": 664.48, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "and international security rather than", "start": 668.16, "duration": 6.08}, {"text": "becoming a new instrument of inequality,", "start": 670.88, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "manipulation, or conflict. At any cost,", "start": 674.24, "duration": 6.719}, {"text": "human accountability, international law,", "start": 677.76, "duration": 5.68}, {"text": "and the peace and security must be", "start": 680.959, "duration": 4.241}, {"text": "safeguarded.", "start": 683.44, "duration": 4.72}, {"text": "Ladies and gentlemen, the credibility of", "start": 685.2, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "the United Nations depends on its", "start": 688.16, "duration": 6.799}, {"text": "ability to respond firmly to aggression,", "start": 691.12, "duration": 8.0}, {"text": "unlawful conquest, forced deportations,", "start": 694.959, "duration": 8.081}, {"text": "and crimes against humanity and also to", "start": 699.12, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "coordinate the global response to the", "start": 703.04, "duration": 4.799}, {"text": "growth of AI.", "start": 705.36, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "I am grateful to the Secretary General,", "start": 707.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "His Excellency Antonio Gutier, for his", "start": 710.16, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "long lasting service and his focus on", "start": 713.36, "duration": 5.84}, {"text": "reforming the United Nations into a more", "start": 716.32, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "effective, modern, and responsive", "start": 719.2, "duration": 5.04}, {"text": "organization.", "start": 722.24, "duration": 5.36}, {"text": "This is the correct path to follow.", "start": 724.24, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "There is no other way. No nation can", "start": 727.6, "duration": 6.479}, {"text": "confront today's challenges alone.", "start": 730.8, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "Aggression cannot win. It is only", "start": 734.079, "duration": 5.601}, {"text": "through multilateralism,", "start": 737.44, "duration": 5.839}, {"text": "solidarity and the unity of all member", "start": 739.68, "duration": 7.04}, {"text": "states that we can uphold peace,", "start": 743.279, "duration": 5.841}, {"text": "security and the rules based", "start": 746.72, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "international order.", "start": 749.12, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "It is also important to learn from the", "start": 751.6, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "many lessons of history today to many", "start": 754.0, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "seem unwilling to recognize and confront", "start": 758.16, "duration": 5.52}, {"text": "the past crimes committed by", "start": 761.12, "duration": 5.6}, {"text": "totalitarian regimes including Soviet", "start": 763.68, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "crimes.", "start": 766.72, "duration": 4.48}, {"text": "This is a fundamental flaw. We must", "start": 768.56, "duration": 5.76}, {"text": "remember the past so as not to repeat", "start": 771.2, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "it.", "start": 774.32, "duration": 4.16}, {"text": "That is why Lethia is promoting the", "start": 776.0, "duration": 5.92}, {"text": "concept of historical remembrance. My", "start": 778.48, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "personal wish is to see the panuropean", "start": 781.92, "duration": 7.12}, {"text": "memorial to all victims of 20th century", "start": 785.2, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "totalitarian regimes unveiled in", "start": 789.04, "duration": 7.039}, {"text": "Brussels as soon as possible.", "start": 791.92, "duration": 6.88}, {"text": "This one lesson Lithuania having", "start": 796.079, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "survived and overcome numerous", "start": 798.8, "duration": 4.88}, {"text": "occupations and the waves of repression", "start": 800.8, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "can share with international community.", "start": 803.68, "duration": 9.76}, {"text": "Freedom can be delayed but it cannot be", "start": 807.76, "duration": 7.519}, {"text": "extinguished.", "start": 813.44, "duration": 4.8}, {"text": "Justice can be challenged but it cannot", "start": 815.279, "duration": 5.201}, {"text": "be defeated.", "start": 818.24, "duration": 5.12}, {"text": "This I believe is a message that goes", "start": 820.48, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "far beyond an experience of the single", "start": 823.36, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "person or the nation. It speaks to the", "start": 826.8, "duration": 6.96}, {"text": "whole humankind united in our shared", "start": 830.32, "duration": 5.199}, {"text": "dignity.", "start": 833.76, "duration": 4.639}, {"text": "At a time of growing global uncertainty", "start": 835.519, "duration": 6.0}, {"text": "and power politics, we need even more", "start": 838.399, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "multilateralism grounded in", "start": 841.519, "duration": 6.32}, {"text": "international law, the UN charter, and", "start": 843.92, "duration": 6.64}, {"text": "universal human rights. We need to", "start": 847.839, "duration": 4.721}, {"text": "resist the law of the strongest", "start": 850.56, "duration": 5.2}, {"text": "collectively in order not to fall under", "start": 852.56, "duration": 6.16}, {"text": "the yoke separately.", "start": 855.76, "duration": 6.72}, {"text": "The time to act is now. And I believe I", "start": 858.72, "duration": 6.4}, {"text": "want to believe that we have what it", "start": 862.48, "duration": 6.24}, {"text": "takes to make the world a more just,", "start": 865.12, "duration": 7.36}, {"text": "secure, peaceful place to live. Thank", "start": 868.72, "duration": 6.76}, {"text": "you.", "start": 872.48, "duration": 3.0}, {"text": "On on behalf of the assembly, I wish to", "start": 878.32, "duration": 6.56}, {"text": "thank the president of the Republic of", "start": 881.839, "duration": 5.521}, {"text": "Lithuania.", "start": 884.88, "duration": 2.48}]